Hi. I was trying to search a way to change the auto assigned abilities of characters (which I failed to levelup to 6 in TBS2) I got by starting TBS3 and tried to edit the my resume.json.

 Me being the noob I am changed moguns ability by simply changing this:

"mogun": {
      "actives": [
        {
          "id": "abl_axe_storm",
          "level": 2,
          "rankAcquired": 7
        }
To this:
"mogun": {
      "actives": [
        {
          "id": "abl_guts",
          "level": 2,
          "rankAcquired": 7
        }

But when I load my save I find mogun to have 3 abilities instead and i can't seem to level its rank. I'm using note++ to edit my saves btw.

I was actually planning on changing all of the auto assigned abilities to my characters because most of them were ruined. Thanks in advance.
